    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's Dye Together is a fast-paced  party platformer shooter where color is your greatest weapon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in a series of minigames, blasting platforms to claim them and creating paths only you can traverse. Adapt, shoot and survive in order to conquer the ever-changing battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Paint the Battlefield in Your Favor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/9a0707fbdc3fee35017b854e4ca2934a.poster.avif?t=1749402539\" width=608 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/9a0707fbdc3fee35017b854e4ca2934a.webm?t=1749402539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/9a0707fbdc3fee35017b854e4ca2934a.mp4?t=1749402539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim territory by blasting the environment with your color, creating safe paths that only you can traverse while making opponents movement more challenging. Stay alert  as your surroundings might change against your favor at any time.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/e9eec6e6aa8746a98cb415c31bd70aca.poster.avif?t=1749402539\" width=608 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/e9eec6e6aa8746a98cb415c31bd70aca.webm?t=1749402539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/e9eec6e6aa8746a98cb415c31bd70aca.mp4?t=1749402539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a diverse arsenal of weapons, each with unique effects that shape the battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/4700cf834e99848c343d6f4810836c3b.poster.avif?t=1749402539\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/4700cf834e99848c343d6f4810836c3b.webm?t=1749402539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/4700cf834e99848c343d6f4810836c3b.mp4?t=1749402539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your skills to the test across a variety of game modes including <strong>Last Man Standing, Domination, Capture the flag </strong>and <strong>more,</strong>\u00a0each offering a unique twist on the color-based chaos. Whether you're fighting for dominance or racing against the clock, every match is a new challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adapt, Shoot, Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/9f8a1662eb200d2e7bd3b0a0f9aa512b.poster.avif?t=1749402539\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/9f8a1662eb200d2e7bd3b0a0f9aa512b.webm?t=1749402539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/9f8a1662eb200d2e7bd3b0a0f9aa512b.mp4?t=1749402539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no time to stand still. React fast and take control of the battlefield before your opponents do. Whether you're working together or fighting for dominance, <strong>Let's Dye Together</strong> delivers a high-energy, unpredictable experience where no two matches are ever the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local and Online Multiplayer</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/93018de879cfbd55552c96eb3f4e63c0.poster.avif?t=1749402539\" width=608 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/93018de879cfbd55552c96eb3f4e63c0.webm?t=1749402539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/93018de879cfbd55552c96eb3f4e63c0.mp4?t=1749402539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with 2-4 players locally and online at the same time, pick a controller and your favorite color and let the fun begin!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's Dye Together is a fast-paced  party platformer shooter where color is your greatest weapon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in a series of minigames, blasting platforms to claim them and creating paths only you can traverse. Adapt, shoot and survive in order to conquer the ever-changing battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Paint the Battlefield in Your Favor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/9a0707fbdc3fee35017b854e4ca2934a.poster.avif?t=1749402539\" width=608 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/9a0707fbdc3fee35017b854e4ca2934a.webm?t=1749402539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/9a0707fbdc3fee35017b854e4ca2934a.mp4?t=1749402539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim territory by blasting the environment with your color, creating safe paths that only you can traverse while making opponents movement more challenging. Stay alert  as your surroundings might change against your favor at any time.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/e9eec6e6aa8746a98cb415c31bd70aca.poster.avif?t=1749402539\" width=608 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/e9eec6e6aa8746a98cb415c31bd70aca.webm?t=1749402539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/e9eec6e6aa8746a98cb415c31bd70aca.mp4?t=1749402539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a diverse arsenal of weapons, each with unique effects that shape the battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/4700cf834e99848c343d6f4810836c3b.poster.avif?t=1749402539\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/4700cf834e99848c343d6f4810836c3b.webm?t=1749402539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/4700cf834e99848c343d6f4810836c3b.mp4?t=1749402539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your skills to the test across a variety of game modes including <strong>Last Man Standing, Domination, Capture the flag </strong>and <strong>more,</strong>\u00a0each offering a unique twist on the color-based chaos. Whether you're fighting for dominance or racing against the clock, every match is a new challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adapt, Shoot, Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/9f8a1662eb200d2e7bd3b0a0f9aa512b.poster.avif?t=1749402539\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/9f8a1662eb200d2e7bd3b0a0f9aa512b.webm?t=1749402539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/9f8a1662eb200d2e7bd3b0a0f9aa512b.mp4?t=1749402539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no time to stand still. React fast and take control of the battlefield before your opponents do. Whether you're working together or fighting for dominance, <strong>Let's Dye Together</strong> delivers a high-energy, unpredictable experience where no two matches are ever the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local and Online Multiplayer</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/93018de879cfbd55552c96eb3f4e63c0.poster.avif?t=1749402539\" width=608 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/93018de879cfbd55552c96eb3f4e63c0.webm?t=1749402539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504390/extras/93018de879cfbd55552c96eb3f4e63c0.mp4?t=1749402539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with 2-4 players locally and online at the same time, pick a controller and your favorite color and let the fun begin!</p>",
